# Hello, world
A first deck for this repo
12 Oct 2026

Shaun Chong

## Hello, world

The program below runs on this machine. Press Run.

.play hello.go

: Lines starting with a colon are presenter notes. Press N to see them.

## Dependencies

A snippet can import a third-party package. This one uses
[go-figure](https://github.com/common-nighthawk/go-figure).

.play banner.go /^package main/,/^}/

Installing the package is not enough: `present` builds each snippet outside
any module. The `go.mod` and `go.sum` it needs are hidden at the bottom of
`banner.go`.

: The first Run downloads go-figure, so it needs network once. Run it before the talk.
